  m_text: "Unlock <color=#77FFCD>Flee</color> and <color=#77FFCD>Evade</color> as
    combat actions.\n\n <color=#77FFCD>[Flee]</color>: Leave combat when you roll
    above the defender.\n\n <color=#77FFCD>[Evade]</color>: Ignore incoming damage
    when you roll above the attacker. Otherwise, take damage as if you rolled a 0."
